{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026ueoOk1Ewhs1794326520.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>甲一籃球聯賽，滿貫贏漢友10分。 </p><p></p><p>綠衫的滿貫首節領先9分，半場被漢友追至差5分。賽前三連勝的滿貫，五位正選得分雙位數，射入五球三分的梁兆華，取得全場最高24分。</p><p></p><p>復出的泰那上場倒戈，協助滿貫險勝永倫2分，今場攻入13分，之後策動快攻，惠龍兒就有15分。</p><p></p><p>漢友只有三人得分雙位數，麥斯維上陣40分鐘，交出10分15籃板。滿貫完三節領先9分，雖然第四節較緊湊，他們最後都贏84-74，取得四連勝。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T17:44:49.899815+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":196,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T16:19:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T06:06:50.077359+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T17:38:11.178581+00:00","content_hash":"6df0ffed89aed1d594f4bd539701ab6813fd1a2f54fd013387fc095d869b012f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-10T17:44:49.899815+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}